			<div class="content" id="post-content-1990125">
									

<p>I have re-worked this SCP using suggestions from the crowd. I believe its more substantial and interesting. Of course that for you to decide. I realize I've been using the main list as a sandbox. I will stop doing that.</p>
<p>-EDIT</p>
<p>In light of the uniform nature of the criticism, I have tried to address certain issues. I know its an arduous process, but for those who care to, please have a read through of the edited version.</p>
<p>And thanks for taking an interest =D</p>
<p>-Edit</p>
<p>One thing I'd love to have people's opinion on. Say the torture angle is still too harsh. What would be a more natural time line as far as the Foundation's response?</p>
<p>For instance:<br />
1. initial alarm at the discovery of the two of them<br />
2. quarantine<br />
3. Nancy Y█████ is discovered absent.<br />
3. colleagues commiserate. advocates are appointed to both of them<br />
4. experimentation, medical, physical, psychological, etc.<br />
5. longer term confinement.<br />
6. interrogation….</p>
<p>then what? Or what other stages in between?</p>

